WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:14.134
It was late at night.

2
00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:16.323
Kip was wide-awake.

3
00:00:16.324 --> 00:00:19.077
Kip looked at his books.

4
00:00:19.078 --> 00:00:24.443
"I have so many books," said Kip.

5
00:00:24.444 --> 00:00:37.974
"I'll stay up and read all night."

6
00:00:37.975 --> 00:00:50.428
Kip made some popcorn.

7
00:00:50.429 --> 00:01:00.747
He took a book off the shelf.

8
00:01:00.748 --> 00:01:03.701
He sat down in his cozy chair.

9
00:01:03.702 --> 00:01:08.202
"I have everything I need," said Kip.

10
00:01:08.203 --> 00:01:14.364
"I have a good book and some popcorn.

11
00:01:14.365 --> 00:01:20.857
I just wish Bird was here."

12
00:01:20.858 --> 00:01:24.087
Kip peeked out his hole.

13
00:01:24.088 --> 00:01:27.109
He looked down at Bird.

14
00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:31.038
"She's sleeping," said Kip.

15
00:01:31.039 --> 00:01:34.772
"I shouldn't wake her up."

16
00:01:34.773 --> 00:01:43.135
Kip went back to his cozy chair.

17
00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:48.908
He ate some popcorn.

18
00:01:48.909 --> 00:01:50.795
He opened his book.

19
00:01:50.796 --> 00:01:54.593
Kip started to read.

20
00:01:54.594 --> 00:01:57.642
It was a very scary book.

21
00:01:57.643 --> 00:02:06.963
It was about a spooky ghost.

22
00:02:06.964 --> 00:02:09.170
"Ah!" cried Kip.

23
00:02:09.171 --> 00:02:16.458
Popcorn went everywhere.

24
00:02:16.459 --> 00:02:22.538
And Bird woke up!
